You can pass argument na.strings="NA" (?read.table) to the
readDataFrame() function of TabularTextFile (your 'dat' object), e.g.

units <- importFrom(ugp, dat, ..., na.strings="NA")

The default is na.strings="---".  Yes, this is a bit odd; seems to be
a remnant from old times.  I might update that later.

/Henrik

