Hi Anita,

I've seen other OSX 64-bit users reporting on the same problem before:

http://groups.google.com/group/aroma-affymetrix/browse_thread/thread/77b3caf398188726

I never understood why there is an 'NA' added after the version number:

<simpleError: invalid version specification 1.6.5NA>

until now.  I think I figured it out and I've updated the files on the
package server.  Restart R (important) and retry:

source("http://www.braju.com/R/hbLite.R");
hbInstall("aroma.affymetrix");

Do you still get that same error?  Please report back - it would be
great if this could be solved.

/Henrik

