troubleshooting to narrow down the source of the problem (and I need
you to run it on your computer to find it).

Ok, so this far the debug output looks ok.  I need to dig into to the
details even more.  Please retry and report again.  You should get
more output this time:

# In a fresh R session:
source("http://www.braju.com/R/hbLite.R");
hbInstallPackages2("BRAJU:aroma.core", force=TRUE, verbose=TRUE, debug=TRUE);

/H

PS. It is that odd 'NA' added to the version numbers that I am after.
That is the reason for all other installation problems you have.

